      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>CONTROLLER</b>

    <b>Dungeon / town</b>

    Move: Left stick / D-pad

    Attack
    / interact / talk: South (A)

    Inventory: West (X)

    Skills: LB / L1

    Ally
    orders (dungeon): East (B)

    Next ally: RB / R1*

    Dungeon map: Select
    / View

    Wait one action: Right stick click

    Turn in place: hold North
    (Y) + direction

    Settings: Start / Menu


    <b>Overworld</b>

    Move:
    Left stick / D-pad

    Interact / unlock: South (A)


    <b>Menus</b>

    Navigate:
    Left stick / D-pad

    Confirm: South (A) | Back: East (B)


    <b>Watching
    autoplay</b>

    Gameplay input opens stop prompt

    Take control: West (X)

    Keep
    watching: East (B)

    Main menu: South (A)


    *Dungeon switching needs Full
    Control

    Off. With it On, order each hero in turn.

    Change this under
    Settings > Gameplay.'
